operty</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://example.org/fhir/eu-ai-transparency/CodeSystem/EUAIActCodeSystem notified-body-id}\">Notified Body ID</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 0123</p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>property</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://example.org/fhir/eu-ai-transparency/CodeSystem/EUAIActCodeSystem expected-lifetime}\">Expected Lifetime</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 5 years<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codea = 'a')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>property</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://example.org/fhir/eu-ai-transparency/CodeSystem/EUAIActCodeSystem medical-purpose}\">Medical Purpose</span></p><p><b>value</b>: Automated detection of lung nodules in CT Thorax scans.</p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>property</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://example.org/fhir/eu-ai-transparency/CodeSystem/EUAIActCodeSystem target-population}\">Target Population</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 38033009}\">Amputation stump</span></p></blockquote><p><b>owner</b>: <a href=\"Organization-org-chronos-medical.html\">Organization St. Chronos Medical Center</a></p><p><b>contact</b>: <a href=\"mailto:support@aetheria-health.test\">support@aetheria-health.test</a>, <a href=\"tel:+4900098765432\">+49 000 98765432</a></p><p><b>note</b>: , </p><blockquote><div><p>Maintenance: Hardware calibration required every 12 months.</p>\n</div></blockquote><blockquote><div><p>Security: Software patches are deployed monthly via remote update.</p>\n</div></blockquote></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
